flickos-installer (1.27) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Mount options move to mount.conf, where Calamares 3.3 reads them:
    installs get noatime again, and btrfs gets noatime,compress=zstd:1
    (restore points design, phase 1a).
  * btrfs installs get the restore points layout: subvolumes @, @home,
    @log, @cache and @snapshots (ADR-001).
  * requiredStorage 15 -> 10, so a 15 GB disk gets its swap partition.
  * partition.conf: a swap choice (none, without and with Hibernate, the
    default) and ext4 or btrfs when erasing a disk; ext4 stays the
    default.

 -- Jon <dvbondoy@gmail.com>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 10:57:26 +0800

