flickos-installer (1.8) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Disable the libpwquality dictionary check: the cracklib dictionary
    isn't installed, so every password failed with "error loading
    dictionary".
  * Depend on squashfs-tools: calamares only Recommends it, and the
    image has no Recommends, so unpackfs failed with "Failed to find
    unsquashfs".
  * Depend on dosfstools: without mkfs.fat the EFI system partition
    can't be formatted.
  * Install GRUB from the pool on the ISO medium: the ISO had no pool,
    so bootloader-config failed with "Package grub-pc has no
    installation candidate" offline. Also install efibootmgr on UEFI.
  * Offline installs: remove only live packages that are in the image
    (apt-get failed with "Unable to locate package live-task-
    localisation"), install cryptsetup-initramfs for encrypted installs
    from the medium's pool, and keep os-prober installed so later
    update-grub runs still find other systems.
  * Final apt sources: same components as the image (contrib and non-
    free too), without backports.

 -- Jon <dvbondoy@gmail.com>  Sat, 19 Sep 2026 14:02:47 +0800

